    // loop tick or less. It no longer affects any recorded value -- every attach
    // field comes from the stamp -- but a large number means the loop is starved and
    // the canopy SAMPLES (which are still scheduled) are worth distrusting.
    format ["chuteAttachDetectionLagS=%1", (_run getOrDefault ["chuteAttachDetectionLagS", -1]) toFixed 3],
